  rdfs:comment           "Imported from Reactome: https://reactome.org/content/detail/R-HSA-76071" , "Provides Input For Rule. The relation 'Binding of TFIIIB to SNAPc:Oct-1:Staf:Type 3 Promoter Complex' 'null' 'Recruitment of RNA Polymerase III to TFIIIB:SNAPc:Type 3 Promoter Complex' was inferred because:\n reaction1 has an output that is an input of reaction 2. " ;
  lego:evidence          gomodel:ev_w_id_R-HSA-83793_RO_0002413_R-HSA-83803_Reactome_R-HSA-76071 ;
